+	 * G0245D v163: drop the pmap_map_bd attempt - it did not work and the
+	 * reason is now clear from the source. pmap_map_bd() resolves to
+	 * PMAP_MAP_BD_DEVICE -> CACHE_ATTRINDX_DISABLE and, more importantly, it
+	 * will not override a mapping that already exists. The physmap range for
+	 * this framebuffer was already built by arm_vm_page_granular_prot() as
+	 * Normal cacheable, so the call was a no-op and the stores still landed
